# Mesh Town for Windows

Builds of [Mesh Town](https://github.com/mesh-town/meshtown) for Windows (x86_64): `meshtown-setup.exe` (installer),
`meshtown.exe` (with the tray icon, no installation) and `meshtown-cli.exe` (console only). The files without a version are the latest version (@VERSION@ at the last
publication). Earlier versions are attached to the [releases](https://github.com/mesh-town/meshtown-dist/releases) of this repository.

## Install

The installer puts Mesh Town in Program Files, adds Start menu and desktop shortcuts and an uninstaller; it asks for
administrator rights. Silent install: `meshtown-setup.exe /S`.

The builds are not signed, so Windows SmartScreen asks for confirmation on the first start: choose "More info", then
"Run anyway". Run only one of the two builds at a time: they share their settings.

Check the download against `SHA256SUMS` before running it.

